{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51051","headline":"书楼 · 白元鉴","name":"书楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业成人已去，陈迹自依然。\n竈有残丹火，窗遗溢宝篇。\n怀贤惊异世，抚事感流年。\n早述《南华》理，遽应返化仙。\n（同前。\n）（〖1〗《洞霄图志》卷四《古迹门·书楼》条：「一名垂象楼，暨天师所居。\n天师少好经史，着述不辍，其中卷秩，委积左右。\n……白元鉴有诗。\n其址亦在今道院内，爲精思流派。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白元鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}